Test builds only (applied by ci/prepare-build.py, never part of the feature's source):
the merged feed's "open stats" diagnostic. After a feed opens, the "Channels in this feed"
dialog shows how it went: time, channels read from the cache or this session's memory and why
the others were not, network requests (average time, parallelism) and flood waits. Regenerate
with `git diff` if the files it touches change.

